DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261126T141500
SUMMARY:Holiday photos with a penguin or an alligator at the Gulfarium
LOCATION:Gulfarium Marine Adventure Park\, 1010 Miracle Strip Parkway SE\, 
 Fort Walton Beach\, FL 32548
DESCRIPTION:Wed 11/25\, Fri 11/27 to Sun 11/29\, then 12/5\, 12/6\, 12/13\,
  12/19\, 12/21 and 12/26 · 1:15 PM\n\nOn select days through the holiday 
 season\, the Gulfarium sets up a festive display where a family can pose b
 eside an African penguin or an American alligator. A trainer or staff memb
 er takes the photo on your own phone\, so there is no print to buy. Guests
  may not touch the animal. Park admission is required and is bought separa
 tely.\n\nPrice: from $26.95\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/event
 s/ev-gulfarium-holiday-photos-penguin-gator-1125.html
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-gulfarium-holiday-photos-penguin
 -gator-1125.html
CATEGORIES:Nature and outdoors
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
