SUMMARY:Sunset cruise from Five Rivers on the Mobile-Tensaw Delta
LOCATION:Bartram Landing\, AWF Delta and Bay Conservation Center at Five Ri
 vers\, AWF Delta and Bay Conservation Center at Five Rivers\, Spanish Fort
 \, AL 36527
DESCRIPTION:Friday 11/27 · 4:20 PM\n\nHistoric Blakeley State Park runs a 
 one-hour sunset cruise that leaves from Bartram Landing at the Delta and B
 ay Conservation Center at Five Rivers. It is short enough for younger kids
  and gets you back in time for a seafood dinner on the Causeway. The cruis
 e runs from 4:20 PM to 5:20 PM.\n\nPrice: from $10\n\nDetails: https://coa
 staleventures.com/events/ev-blakeley-five-rivers-sunset-cruise-1127.html
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-blakeley-five-rivers-sunset-crui
 se-1127.html
CATEGORIES:Nature and outdoors
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
