LOCATION:Admiral Mason Park\, then Cactus Cantina\, 200 S 9th Ave\, Pensaco
 la\, FL 32502
DESCRIPTION:Sunday 12/13 · 3:30 PM to 6:15 PM\n\nThe Francis M. Weston Aud
 ubon Society pairs a short bird walk with tacos. The group explores Admira
 l Mason Park from 3:30 PM to 4:30 PM looking for winter visitors\, then mo
 ves to Cactus Cantina at 601 East Gregory Street from 4:45 PM to 6:15 PM. 
 The park is accessible\, the society calls it a good fit for new birders\,
  and a few binoculars are available to borrow.\n\nPrice: Free\n\nDetails: 
 https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-fmwas-birds-and-brew-admiral-mason-
 1213.html
