  story time called The Christmas Owl for the youngest visitors. Kids get a
 n up-close look at a live owl and learn how it hunts and survives\, then d
 o a hands-on activity or craft. The program is best suited for children ag
 e 6 and under. Parents must stay but do not need to register.\n\nPrice: fr
 om $3\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-gsp-christmas-owl
 -1219.html
