SUMMARY:Hidden Treasure: From the Delta to the Gulf with Dr. John Dindo at 
 Bellingrath
LOCATION:Bellingrath Gardens and Home: Magnolia Cafe\, 12401 Bellingrath Ga
 rdens Road\, Theodore\, AL 36582
DESCRIPTION:Wednesday 2/3 · 1:00 PM to 2:00 PM\n\nDr. John Dindo\, Associa
 te Director of the Dauphin Island Sea Lab\, presents slides and video of t
 he Mobile-Tensaw Delta\, often called America's Amazon\, and follows its w
 aters to the Gulf of Mexico. The talk is on Wednesday\, February 3\, 2027\
 , in the Magnolia Cafe at Bellingrath. Non-members pay $15 and members att
 end free.\n\nPrice: from $15\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/even
 ts/ev-bellingrath-hidden-treasure-dindo-0203.html
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-bellingrath-hidden-treasure-dind
 o-0203.html
