SUMMARY:UWF Camellia Garden guided tour with the Pensacola Camellia Club
LOCATION:UWF Camellia Garden\, University of West Florida\, 11000 Universit
 y Parkway\, Pensacola\, FL 32514
DESCRIPTION:Sunday 3/7 · 12:00 PM to 4:00 PM\n\nThe Pensacola Camellia Clu
 b welcomes the public to a guided tour of the UWF Camellia Garden\, a thre
 e-fourths acre garden of Pensacola registered varieties and camellias from
  around the world. UWF student ambassadors shuttle visitors by golf cart b
 etween the parking lots and the garden. Members demonstrate pruning and ai
 r-layering\, and plants are for sale from noon to 4:00 PM.\n\nPrice: No pu
 blished price\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-uwf-camel
 lia-garden-tour-0307.html
